<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 198 0 R
/E (Ultimately, this system transforms raw geospatial data into actionable maritime situational awareness, significantly improving collision prevention, port congestion management, and anomaly monitoring such as AIS spoofing or route deviations. By serving these analytics through a live interactive dashboard coupled with a Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) LLM assistant, operators can query complex streaming data in natural language. This seamless bridge between real-time data engineering, deep learning analytics, and conversational AI provides maritime authorities with an accessible, highly scalable tool to optimize fleet efficiency and strengthen maritime security. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [4]
>>
